STIGATION CONCERNING POSSIBLE BREACHES OF FIDUCIARY DUTY BY CERTAIN OFFICERS AND DIRECTORS OF EASTMAN CHEMICAL COMPANY (EMN)', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - MARCH 31, 2021) - LEVI & KORSINSKY ANNOUNCES IT HAS COMMENCED AN INVESTIGATION OF EASTMAN CHEMICAL COMPANY (NYSE: EMN) CONCERNING POSSIBLE BREACHES OF FIDUCIARY DUTY. TO OBTAIN ADDITIONAL INFORMATION, GO TO:HTTPS://WWW.ZLK.COM/COMPENSATION2/EASTMAN-CHEMICAL-COMPANY-INFORMATION-REQUEST-FORM\\OR CONTACT JOSEPH E. LEVI, ESQ. EITHER VIA EMAIL AT JLEVI@LEVIKORSINSKY.COM OR BY TELEPHONE AT (212) 363-7500. THERE IS NO COST OR OBLIGATION TO YOU.'}{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2021-03-31 13:38:00', 'title': "FIRSTENERGY'S OHIO UTILITIES TO RETURN PREVIOUSLY COLLECTED DECOUPLING REVENUES TO CUSTOMERS", 'text': "AKRON, OHIO, MARCH 31, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS OHIO UTILITIES – OHIO EDISON,\xa0THE ILLUMINATING COMPANY\xa0AND TOLEDO EDISON – WILL COLLECTIVELY CREDIT CUSTOMERS APPROXIMATELY $26 MILLION IN REVENUES THAT WERE PREVIOUSLY COLLECTED THROUGH A DECOUPLING MECHANISM AUTHORIZED UNDER OHIO LAW. OVER THE PAST SEVERAL MONTHS, FIRSTENERGY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS AND MANAGEMENT TEAM HAVE TAKEN STEPS TO REDUCE REGULATORY UNCERTAINTY AFFECTING THE COMPANY'S OHIO UTILITIES."}{'symbol': 'FISV', 'date': '2021-03-31 07:00:00', 'title': 'PSG AGREES TO SELL PINEAPPLE PAYMENTS TO FISERV', 'text': 'BOSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PSG, A LEADING GROWTH EQUITY FIRM PARTNERING WITH MIDDLE-MARKET SOFTWARE AND TECHNOLOGY-ENABLED SERVICE COMPANIES TO HELP THEM NAVIGATE TRANSFORMATIONAL GROWTH, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS SIGNED A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO SELL PINEAPPLE PAYMENTS, A PAYMENTS TECHNOLOGY PROVIDER, TO FISERV, INC. (NASDAQ: FISV), A GLOBAL LEADER IN PAYMENTS AND FINANCIAL SERVICES TECHNOLOGY SOLUTIONS. PINEAPPLE WILL JOIN THE GLOBAL BUSINESS SOLUTIONS DIVISION OF FISERV AS PART OF THE PARTNE'}{'symbol': 'GILD', 'date': '2021-03-31 00:26:00', 'title': 'GILEAD SCIENCES COMMENTS ON THE PASSING OF JOHN C. MARTIN, PHD', 'text': "FOSTER CITY, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--GILEAD SCIENCES, INC. (NASDAQ: GILD) TODAY RELEASED THE FOLLOWING STATEMENT ON THE DEATH OF JOHN C. MARTIN, PHD, WHO SERVED AS THE COMPANY'S CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER FROM 1996 TO 2016 AND AS ITS CHAIRMAN FROM 2008 TO 2019. IT IS WITH GREAT SADNESS THAT THE COMPANY HAS LEARNED OF THE PASSING OF DR. MARTIN, WHOSE SCIENTIFIC VISION AND LEADERSHIP HELPED TRANSFORM THE LIVES OF MILLIONS OF PATIENTS AND SHAPE GILEAD INTO THE COMPANY THAT IT IS TODAY. JOHN BEGAN HI"}{'symbol': 'HPE', 'date': '2021-03-31 02:00:00', 'title': 'HEWLETT PACKARD ENTERPRISE ANNOUNCES 150 NEW HIGH TECH JOBS IN IRELAND', 'text': 'LEIXLIP, CO. KILDARE, IRELAND--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BUILDING ON ITS LONG TERM COMMITMENT TO THE COUNTRY, NEW JOBS WILL BE IN THE FIELDS OF R&D, CYBER SECURITY, SOFTWARE DEVELOPMENT AND CLOUD CONSULTING.'}{'symbol': 'HLT', 'date': '2021-03-31 09:00:00', 'title': 'WORLD TRAVEL & TOURISM COUNCIL, CARNIVAL CORPORATION AND HILTON PRESENT THE 2021 GLOBAL SCIENTIFIC SUMMIT ON COVID-19', 'text': "LONDON, MARCH 31, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE WORLD TRAVEL & TOURISM COUNCIL (WTTC) – TOGETHER WITH THE WORLD'S LARGEST CRUISE COMPANY, CARNIVAL CORPORATION \xa0& PLC\xa0(NYSE/LSE: CCL; NYSE: CUK), AND THE LEADING GLOBAL HOSPITALITY COMPANY HILTON WORLDWIDE HOLDINGS INC.\xa0(NYSE: HLT) – TODAY ANNOUNCED THE 2021 GLOBAL SCIENTIFIC SUMMIT ON COVID-19. THE FREE LIVE VIRTUAL FORUM, WHICH IS OPEN TO THE PUBLIC, WILL TAKE PLACE FROM 10:00 AM TO 1:30 PM (EDT) [3:00 PM TO 6:30 PM GMT] [4:00 PM TO 7:30 PM CEST] ON THURSDAY, APRIL 15, 2021."}{'symbol': 'JCI', 'date': '2021-03-31 09:31:00', 'title': "JOHNSON CONTROLS' SCIENCE-BASED EMISSION REDUCTION TARGETS APPROVED", 'text': "CORK, IRELAND, MARCH 31, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0JOHNSON CONTROLS\xa0(NYSE: JCI),\xa0THE GLOBAL LEADER FOR SMART, HEALTHY AND SUSTAINABLE BUILDINGS,\xa0TODAY\xa0ANNOUNCED THE SCIENCE BASED TARGETS INITIATIVE (SBTI) HAS APPROVED ITS AMBITIOUS EMISSIONS REDUCTIONS TARGETS. THE SBTI VALIDATION FURTHER PROVES THE STRENGTH OF OUR CORE STRATEGY – SUPPORTING A HEALTHY, MORE SUSTAINABLE PLANET THE TARGETS COVERING GREENHOUSE GAS (GHG) EMISSIONS FROM JOHNSON CONTROLS'\xa0OPERATIONS (SCOPES 1 AND 2) ARE CONSISTENT WITH REDUCTIONS REQUIRED TO KEEP WARMING TO 1.5°C, THE MOST AMBITIOUS GOAL OF THE PARIS AGREEMENT."}{'symbol': 'KSU', 'date': '2021-03-31 19:30:00', 'title': 'CANADIAN PACIFIC, KANSAS CITY SOUTHERN RECEIVE WIDESPREAD SUPPORT FOR CREATING FIRST U.S.-MEXICO-CANADA RAIL NETWORK', 'text': 'NEARLY 260 STATEMENTS FROM SHIPPERS AND SUPPORTERS FILED WITH THE SURFACE TRANSPORTATION BOARD IN SUPPORT OF CP-KCS COMBINATION SHIPPERS AND SUPPORTERS ANTICIPATE INCREASED EFFICIENCY AND MARKET REACH, ENHANCED COMPETITION AND NORTH AMERICAN ECONOMIC GROWTH CALGARY AND KANSAS CITY, MO., MARCH 31, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ - CANADIAN PACIFIC RAILWAY LIMITED (TSX: CP) (NYSE: CP) ("CP") AND KANSAS CITY SOUTHERN (NYSE: KSU) ("KCS") TODAY ANNOUNCED THEY HAVE RECEIVED STATEMENTS FROM NEARLY 260 SHIPPERS, OTHER RAILROADS, ECONOMIC DEVELOPMENT AUTHORITIES, PORTS, AND OTHER SUPPORTERS FOR THEIR PLANNED COMBINATION THAT WOULD CREATE THE FIRST\xa0RAIL NETWORK CONNECTING THE U.S., MEXICO, AND CANADA.'}{'symbol': 'KEYS', 'date': '2021-03-31 11:00:00', 'title': 'KEYSIGHT SPEEDS INSTALLATION OF 5G, RADAR AND SATELLITE COMMUNICATION SYSTEMS WITH NEW HIGH-PERFORMANCE HANDHELD MICROWAVE ANALYZER', 'text': 'SANTA ROSA, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $KEYS #5G--KEYSIGHT SPEEDS INSTALLATION OF 5G, RADAR AND SATELLITE COMMUNICATION SYSTEMS WITH NEW HIGH-PERFORMANCE HANDHELD MICROWAVE ANALYZER'}{'symbol': 'KMB', 'date': '2021-03-31 08:30:00', 'title': 'KIMBERLY-CLARK ANNOUNCES PRICE INCREASES FOR NORTH AMERICAN CONSUMER PRODUCTS BUSINESS', 'text': 'DALLAS, MARCH 31, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0KIMBERLY-CLARK CORPORATION (NYSE: KMB) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT IS NOTIFYING CUSTOMERS IN THE U.S. AND CANADA OF PLANS TO INCREASE NET SELLING PRICES ACROSS A MAJORITY OF